$MDESC::Type = "TAC";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> TAC Defend & Destroy" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Tyr's Cradle" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Cold" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Night" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> The <vServer::teamName0> and <vServer::teamName1> tribes are battling on the remote planet of Tyr's Cradle. The objective in this mission is to destroy the 3 generators and the medium pulse sensor located at the enemy's high rise facility. Each generator is worth 50 points and the sensor is worth 50 points as well. Access to the generators may be gained by blasting the doors individualy or by taking out the generators powering the complex doors and ammo stations. These can be found on the ground floor behind a blast door. The first team to reach 180 points by objective destruction or APC kills is the victor!" @
	 "\n\n<f1>For the TAC Mod:<f0> www.tribes-universe.com/tac/" @
	 "\n\n<f1>Map designed by:<f0> [TPG]SaNTa[DTM]";
